{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570330/extras/Final_Logo.png?t=1742646517\" /><strong>9 Trials of Whiskers</strong> is a <strong>charming yet challenging 3D platformer</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump and dodge hazards as you challenge each of the Trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo offers 5/9 trials and most features such as timed runs including local leaderboards and ghosts of your previous runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570330/extras/Level_5_02.png?t=1742646517\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in <strong>Tourist Mode</strong> for a relaxing experience or push your limits in <strong>Hard Mode</strong> to master every trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570330/extras/Ghost_2.png?t=1742646517\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you in the Trials =(^_^)=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570330?t=1742646517","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570330/8fed2ddc6fc2ba308b0d77c2befcf4303c80aada/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742646517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570330/0432f5019fbc425586c35081819536c8fed2323b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742646517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570330/0432f5019fbc425586c35081819536c8fed2323b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742646517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it